cli-ask (0.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Standardize Alt+RightArrow (Alt+→) as the default submit key across all interactive workflows.
  * Rebrand shell AI autocompletion to Ghost-Complete (ask --ghost-complete).
  * Add build-aware system context probing and caching (OS distro/build, shell & version, package managers).
  * Add dynamic process elevation probing (root / Administrator) without post-processing.
  * Add dedicated word navigation via Ctrl+Right/Left arrow keys in composer and chat UI.
  * Maintain backward-compatible fallbacks for Ctrl+S, Ctrl+Enter, and Alt+Enter.

 -- Mugunthan <mugunth13@proton.me>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 20:50:00 +0800

cli-ask (0.4.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix Ctrl+Enter submission on terminal emulators that swallow Ctrl modifier with Enter.
  * Enable Kitty Keyboard Protocol (CSI > 1 u) and xterm modifyOtherKeys (CSI > 4 ; 2 m) on raw mode entry.
  * Add universal Ctrl+S and Alt+Enter alternative submit shortcuts for terminals intercepting Ctrl+Enter.
  * Cleanly restore terminal keyboard flags on composer exit and alternate screen cleanup.
  * Update man page and documentation with universal submit shortcuts.

 -- Mugunthan <mugunth13@proton.me>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:30:00 +0800

cli-ask (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add inline multiline framed composer for interactive ask without arguments.
  * Keep submitted prompts and streaming model responses directly in terminal scrollback.
  * Modernize interactive chat UI (-i) with subtle prompt background tint and lean header bar.
  * Add soft-wrap aware copying preserving original paragraph structure.
  * Add vim-style yank (y), copy (c), and Enter to copy in history mode.
  * Add clean exit confirmation UI and context-sensitive keybinding hints.
  * Support instant terminal resize and zoom without display corruption.
  * Eliminate arrow key escape sequence bleed during rapid keystrokes.

